{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/860642-ms-broken","id":860642,"title":"Ms. Broken","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-06T16:55:03-07:00","id":860642,"title":"Ms. Broken","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://orig06.deviantart.net/9f19/f/2015/240/f/3/apokalypsis_by_hypnothalamus-d97hbow.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><i>Ms. Broken, The One Ephemeral</i></span><br /> <br /> <b>Virtue:</b> Calm, Loyal<br /> <b>Vice:</b> Distant<br /> <b>Concept:</b> Foreign - Very Foreign<br /> <b>Catalyst:</b> &lt;I'm actually unsure - I know it has to do with &quot;her&quot; original mission (study spirit hierarchies), but I'm not sure what the event was, exactly.&gt;<br /> <br /> <b>Incarnation - Agenda:</b> Analyst - Integrator<br /> <b>Embeds:</b> Anarchism (First Key), Alibi<br /> <b>Exploits:</b> Decoy, Ephemeral Cover (Inquisitor)<br /> <br /> <b>Aspirations:</b><br /> \u2022 [Short] Find My Human Part a Job<br /> \u2022 [Short] Fail to Understand Human Social Mores<br /> \u2022 [Long] Integrate Myself into the Local Spirit Hierarchy<br /> <br /> <b>Demonic Form:</b><br /> <i>Modifications:</i> Huge Size, Inhuman Intelligence, Sonic Acuity<br /> <i>Processes:</i> Cavernous Maw<br /> <i>Propulsion:</i> Plasma Drive<br /> <i>Technologies:</i> Blind Sense, Inhuman Beauty<br /> <br /> <b>Attributes</b><br /> <i>Physical</i>: STR 3/DEX 2/STA 2<br /> <i>Mental</i>: INT 4/WIT 2/RES 2<br /> <i>Social</i>: PRE 2/MAN 1/COM 3<br /> <br /> <b>Skills</b><br /> <i>Physical</i>: Athletics \u2022 (In Twilight), Brawl \u2022, Stealth \u2022\u2022<br /> <i>Mental</i>: Investigation \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022, Occult \u2022\u2022\u2022, Politics \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 (Spirits)<br /> <i>Social</i>: Empathy \u2022\u2022\u2022 (Emotional Resonance), Persuasion \u2022\u2022 (Inhuman Actions), Subterfuge \u2022\u2022<br /> <br /> <b>Merits</b><br /> Area of Expertise (Politics: Spirits) \u2022<br /> Cultists \u2022\u2022\u2022<br /> Fixer \u2022<br /> Interdisciplinary Speciality (Politics: Spirits) \u2022<br /> Small Frame \u2022\u2022<br /> Virtuous \u2022\u2022<br /> <hr /><br /> The basic concept is that Ms. Broken was originally an angel designed to interface with and (hopefully) subvert spirit hierarchies. I'm thinking that most of her Covers are made through Ephemeral Cover (with the exception of her human cover, a 20-something Plain Jane that hangs out mostly in the background).<br /> <br /> Her Cipher is &quot;Obligations and desires are one and the same&quot;; I'm sorta seeing it go Anarchism \u2192 Call Out \u2192 Everybody Knows \u2192 Apple of Discord, but I don't know what it <i>does</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-06T19:38:06-07:00","id":860728,"title":"","content":"I'm curious; how is she an Integrator? I mean, maybe if you understand why she chose to align herself with that philosophy after she fell, you'll understand what her fall was.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-06T21:09:37-07:00","id":860768,"title":"","content":"She's very much the type that sees her Fall as a personal failure - hence the name &quot;Ms. Broken&quot;. She wants to integrate by &quot;fixing&quot; herself, if that makes sense.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-06T22:54:59-07:00","id":860807,"title":"","content":"I am disturbed and intrigued","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-07T10:13:59-07:00","id":861124,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/860642-ms-broken#post860642\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Her Cipher is &quot;Obligations and desires are one and the same&quot;; I'm sorta seeing it go Anarchism \u2192 Call Out \u2192 Everybody Knows \u2192 Apple of Discord, but I don't know what it <i>does</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Interlocks, her Hell, the Cipher itself?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-07T11:44:10-07:00","id":861180,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eremite</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/860642-ms-broken?p=861124#post861124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Interlocks, her Hell, the Cipher itself?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure about the Interlocks and her Hell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-07T13:02:09-07:00","id":861230,"title":"","content":"Here are some quick and dirty ideas based around dismantling and subverting hierarchies. Not sure they'll translate too well to spirit courts, though..<br /> <br /> Anarchism + Call Out<br /> This Interlock (temporarily) destroys social connections.You could use Conditions for this, but I'd model it by locking the target's relevant social merits for a while (Contacts, Hobbyist Clique. Status, etc). I'd say days equal to successes rolled or Primum. This power should probably be resisted with Composure. Name ideas: Isolate, Cut Loose, You And What Army<br /> <br /> Call Out + Everybody Knows<br /> Use this to temporarily subvert or even create a position in a hierarchy (taking the role of someone you've isolated with the other two Interlocks seems like a great use). I'd avoid temporary Merit dots and use the Connected Condition for this one. Name ideas: Integrate, The Masquerade, Promotion<br /> <br /> Everybody Knows + Apple of Discord<br /> This Interlock can dethrone someone. It creates a scandal - a minor issue becomes is blown out of all proportion and could end a career. Old wounds, long healed, have their scabs knocked off. Suddenly, leaders (kings, boards, inner circles, whatever) find their subordinates mutinous. Options for how to make this work mechanically,.. The Betrayed or Notoriety Condition, losing social merits (but that's the same as Interlock one). A better way might be to affect multiple people in an organisation to empower them against someone. A merit that gives them a bonus when acting against them, perhaps. .<br /> Name ideas: Eliminate (crappy, but Isolate-Integrate-Eliminate is pretty cool), The Emperor's New Clothes, Dethrone, Defenestrate<br /> <br /> The Cipher and her final secret kinda feel more Tempter to me. It feels almost as though she should trying to make herself a monarch of a spirit court. For more Integrator-y twists, perhaps she's trying to make the God-Machine/a loyal servant of same (why not herself?) the ruler of a court... or even twist courts in Its image.(though that makes her potentially insane and dangerous, more of an antagonist)<br /> <br /> Cool art, BTW. I like some angels that are more weird than biomechanical.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":452,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","user":"Eremite","date":". 04-16-2016, 11:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-07T15:46:06-07:00","id":861382,"title":"","content":"This is a great idea. It's in stark contrast to the great majority of Demons. The image is really cool. Where did you find it? I was reminded of the image at 2:20 in <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gMmYxC8FuZU\" target=\"_blank\"><b>this</b></a> video (warning: possibly disturbing).<br /> <br /> Now I'm imagining a similar Demon who uses Ephemeral Cover and Rip The Gates to explore and draw power from the Underworld. By the way, you might wanna give her the Rip The Gates Exploit so she can enter the Shadow. <br /> <br /> Eremite's ideas for the Cipher and her Hell are interesting, but she seems like she'd work best as a mysterious canvas you can fill with whatever you find the most alien and intriguing. I have a hard time visualizing her as a PC. By the way, she wants to fail at understanding humans as one of her Aspirations? I get that's she's supposed to be very strange, but this could probably be phrased differently.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-07T16:11:04-07:00","id":861400,"title":"","content":"The image is from one of the people I follow on Deviantart; you can find it <a href=\"http://hypnothalamus.deviantart.com/art/Apokalypsis-556761200\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.<br /> <br /> As for Rip The Gates - that could be part of how she &quot;broke&quot; - she followed a Spirit into Twilight, and fell as a result.<br /> <br /> And that Aspiration is totally legit - Aspirations are what you as a player want for your character, not what your character wants.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-07T16:15:05-07:00","id":861401,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/860642-ms-broken?p=861400#post861400\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The image is from one of the people I follow on Deviantart; you can find it <a href=\"http://hypnothalamus.deviantart.com/art/Apokalypsis-556761200\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.<br /> <br /> As for Rip The Gates - that could be part of how she &quot;broke&quot; - she followed a Spirit into Twilight, and fell as a result.<br /> <br /> And that Aspiration is totally legit - Aspirations are what you as a player want for your character, not what your character wants.</div> </div> </div> </div> Thanks for the source. And when you put Aspirations like that, it makes a lot more sense.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T20:37:53-07:00","id":869061,"title":"","content":"I just realized what the Cipher means - or at least, I remembered why I chose to phrase it that way.<br /> <br /> It's the fundamental insight that there is no <i>distinction</i> between desire and obligation; that your duties and obligations aren't separate from you, but are part and parcel of your identity. When you say &quot;I must&quot;, you are saying &quot;I wish to&quot;, and vice-versa.<br /> <br /> I like Isolate, Integrate, and Eliminate as names, by the way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}